  "content": "{section: Verso 1}\n[Asus2] [A5] [G] [D] (riff x4)\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[C5]The world has come un-done. Like to\n[G5]change it every day.\n[D5]Change don't come at once. There's a\n[Asus2]wave building before it breaks.\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[Asus2] [A5] [G] [D] (riff x4)\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[C5]The world has come un-done. Like to\n[G5]change it every day.\n[D5]Change don't come at once. There's a\n[Asus2]wave building before it breaks.\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[E5]All this hope... [Bsus4]\n[Asus2] (riff)\n\n{section: Outro}\n[G5] [A5] (x6)"
